  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Congo Basin Forest Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the commitment is to provide funding for projects to slow down deforestation, by developing the capacity of peoples and institutions in the Congo Basin countries to manage their forest and alleviating poverty by helping the local communities to get appropriate &amp; sustainable  livehoods that are consistent with the conservation of forests. It supposes the commitment of the Congo Basin states to establish &amp; implement holistic national strategies for the preservation of their forest</narrative>
  </description>
